Description: VeltOS Calculator, a Windows 11 style calculator
 The Standard and Scientific modes of Windows 11's Calculator: operations
 in the order they are entered (Standard) or with precedence and
 parentheses (Scientific), percent, square, square root and reciprocal,
 trigonometry in degrees, radians and gradians, logarithms, powers and
 roots, factorial, memory (MS, MR, M+, M-, MC) and history, the
 navigation pane, "Keep on top" and an app theme setting (light, dark or
 the system's).
 .
 Decimal arithmetic: 0.1 + 0.2 is exactly 0.3; like Windows, more digits
 are kept than shown.
